vocab.tsv
  Frequency ranks, parts of speech, transliterations and glosses for the 5,000
  most frequent Persian words. Glosses are the project's own wording.
  Homographs are split into separate lemmas; rare readings carry placeholder
  ranks 5001-5080 until real frequencies are available.

grammar.yaml, config.yaml
  The project's own work. Levels follow the usual sequence of Persian-as-a-foreign-
  language courses and are provisional. Patterns were written against the output of
  Stanza's Persian model (trained on UD Persian-PerDT, CC BY-SA 4.0); no treebank
  data is included here. tools/fa_eval_perdt.py reads the treebank at run time.
